WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
The first back medium kick hits as a Punish Counter.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.900
The medium-kick target follow-up connects.

3
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.350
OD Dégagé extends the target combo.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.150
Standing medium punch connects after the OD extension.

5
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.850
Light Dégagé hits low to end the route.

6
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.000
Manon and Ryu recover at the final spacing.
